Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.74,0:00:11.82,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Mighty Little Defenders 11 – New Wild Cosmos.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.10,0:00:16.74,Title,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}Energy Fragments
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.10,0:00:16.74,Title1,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}Episode 12
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.38,0:12:36.94,end,,0,0,0,,To be continued
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:05.00,Default,,0,0,0,,------------------------------------------------------
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.90,0:00:21.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, my Bulala
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.05,0:01:02.29,Default,,0,0,0,,He became a giant
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.29,0:01:04.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Brother, stop it
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.73,0:01:06.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Don’t make the same mistake again and again
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.43,0:01:11.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Only those with power can decide between wrong and right
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.24,0:01:19.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Just let me calm him down.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.87,0:01:22.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Wolffy
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.91,0:01:27.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone, be careful
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.39,0:01:32.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Uncle, don’t make the same mistake again and again.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.51,0:01:33.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Change your evil ways and return to the right ways
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.39,0:01:38.63,Default,,0,0,0,,It’s not your turn to make irresponsible remarks to me
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.74,0:01:57.54,Default,,0,0,0,,What
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.53,0:02:13.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Knocked him down
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.46,0:02:20.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Uncle
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.73,0:02:31.13,Default,,0,0,0,,This fragment contains too much energy.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.21,0:02:33.60,Default,,0,0,0,,It must have flown in through the rift.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.44,0:02:37.49,Default,,0,0,0,,And this powerful fragment
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.49,0:02:41.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I’m afraid only the monster knows its origins
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.34,0:02:54.17,Default,,0,0,0,,You guys
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.73,0:02:58.37,Default,,0,0,0,,don’t think you can really defeat me, do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.74,0:03:03.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone, run quickly
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.05,0:03:09.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Weslie, Wolffy
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.27,0:03:13.66,Default,,0,0,0,,That thing of yours can’t deal with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.58,0:03:19.38,Default,,0,0,0,,stop
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.27,0:03:23.98,Default,,0,0,0,,With your little strength, you still want to stop me
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.74,0:03:30.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Weslie
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.41,0:03:40.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Aren’t you still going to give in?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.70,0:03:48.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Sweetie, are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.78,0:03:50.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Ticking is of no use to me
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.69,0:04:01.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Go quickly
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.85,0:04:05.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Son, don’t stop
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.66,0:04:15.62,Default,,0,0,0,,son
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.01,0:04:28.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Little Cutie, please do me a favor
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.58,0:04:37.38,Default,,0,0,0,,This is
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.73,0:04:39.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Send them all away
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.07,0:04:41.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Actually want to escape?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.06,0:04:51.67,Default,,0,0,0,,You can’t deal with Uncle by yourself
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.83,0:04:54.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Father
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.80,0:05:08.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Where does this strength in you come from?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.87,0:05:14.21,Default,,0,0,0,,You finally know that Golden Bulala is not the strongest force, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.72,0:05:33.40,Default,,0,0,0,,So now I have this great power
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.76,0:05:37.70,Default,,0,0,0,,It must be this strange power that makes you become what you are now
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.82,0:05:41.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I have loved collecting various Bulala since I was a child
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.17,0:05:45.13,Default,,0,0,0,,But Father said that Bulala is very precious and won’t let me squander it casually.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.17,0:05:49.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I’ve wanted to be the King since I was a kid, but you blocked me
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.42,0:05:51.69,Default,,0,0,0,,But when the monster knocks you away
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.69,0:05:53.13,Default,,0,0,0,,I finally found the way
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.13,0:05:56.61,Default,,0,0,0,,how to collect Bulala using the monster
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.61,0:06:02.33,Default,,0,0,0,,It also takes advantage of everyone’s ignorance about the monster.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.17,0:06:08.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Who knew you would be rescued by Sparky again?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.29,0:06:11.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Until I got this power
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.08,0:06:15.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I found that as long as I have enough power,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.77,0:06:17.61,Default,,0,0,0,,the Bulala I want,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.09,0:06:21.52,Default,,0,0,0,,the throne I want, and the love and respect of the residents—
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.40,0:06:25.65,Default,,0,0,0,,I can have them all
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.01,0:06:28.61,Default,,0,0,0,,You are indeed better than me in many ways
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.13,0:06:31.09,Default,,0,0,0,,but you are not a good king
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.92,0:06:34.30,Default,,0,0,0,,It seems that you are still being stubborn
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.30,0:06:38.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Give you one night to think about whether I am a good king or not.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.58,0:06:41.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Otherwise I will untie your Heart Knot
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.61,0:06:52.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone, are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.48,0:06:56.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Fortunately, we are fine
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.00,0:06:58.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Why
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.66,0:07:00.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Why Father?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.22,0:07:04.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Let’s contact Grandpa Bulala and ask about the current situation in the city.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.81,0:07:12.61,Default,,0,0,0,,His Majesty’s Heart Knot
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.69,0:07:14.72,Default,,0,0,0,,is going to be untied
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.52,0:07:19.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to go back and save Father
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.65,0:07:24.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Let go, don’t hold me
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.44,0:07:27.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Sparky, calm down.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.68,0:07:30.76,Default,,0,0,0,,If we go back now, we will die.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.32,0:07:33.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Aren’t you usually very calm?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.64,0:07:36.72,Default,,0,0,0,,At this time, you should be calmer
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.68,0:07:43.68,Default,,0,0,0,,If you go back now, all His Majesty’s efforts will be in vain.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.92,0:07:46.12,Default,,0,0,0,,So shall we do nothing?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.64,0:07:55.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Sparky
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.28,0:07:58.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought of a way to save His Majesty
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.24,0:08:19.72,Default,,0,0,0,,The time has come, my dear brother
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.09,0:08:23.69,Default,,0,0,0,,How do you think about it?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.93,0:08:26.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Still the same sentence
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.84,0:08:29.32,Default,,0,0,0,,You will never be a good king
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.93,0:08:33.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Then don’t blame me
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.53,0:08:35.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Untie his Heart Knot
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.24,0:08:37.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Ready
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.80,0:08:38.96,Default,,0,0,0,,start up
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.94,0:08:48.05,Default,,0,0,0,,What’s going on
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.37,0:09:00.53,Default,,0,0,0,,How dare you come back?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.41,0:09:05.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Bulala flies away as soon as the wind blows
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.33,0:09:07.34,Default,,0,0,0,,We can transform windmills in the city
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.50,0:09:10.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Use the wind to blow away Master Quan’s Bulala
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.58,0:09:13.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Once he loses his strength, we’ll have a chance to fight back.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.50,0:09:15.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Transformation is my forte, I’ll do it
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.10,0:09:18.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Great, that way we have a chance of winning
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.02,0:09:20.06,Default,,0,0,0,,not enough
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.34,0:09:22.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Uncle’s ability is too powerful
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.10,0:09:24.86,Default,,0,0,0,,We must also have the power to compete
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.02,0:09:28.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought of a way to get more power
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.39,0:09:35.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Then we
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.71,0:09:36.87,Default,,0,0,0,,split up
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.67,0:09:56.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Already gone
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.03,0:09:59.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are you back?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.06,0:10:02.14,Default,,0,0,0,,We have a way to save His Majesty
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.30,0:10:03.22,Default,,0,0,0,,you can
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.22,0:10:03.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.26,0:10:05.83,Default,,0,0,0,,We also need to help
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.39,0:10:08.83,Default,,0,0,0,,His Majesty used to help us a lot
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.31,0:10:12.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Now that His Majesty has something to do, we have to do our part for His Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.18,0:10:14.34,Default,,0,0,0,,let’s come together
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.58,0:10:18.52,Default,,0,0,0,,His Majesty is back after all the hard trip. How can we give up?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.24,0:10:20.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I’m coming too
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.44,0:10:21.51,Default,,0,0,0,,and us too
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.99,0:10:25.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Then your method is
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.03,0:10:27.91,Default,,0,0,0,,that’s it
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.50,0:10:35.58,Default,,0,0,0,,start up
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.78,0:10:36.90,Default,,0,0,0,,start up
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.35,0:10:48.63,Default,,0,0,0,,What’s the use of being so big?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.83,0:10:51.98,Default,,0,0,0,,There are buildings below the city to block the wind. Look at you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.02,0:10:56.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone, come here quickly. The wind will get stronger in a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.38,0:11:03.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Don’t underestimate me
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.58,0:11:13.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Bulala come here quickly
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.65,0:11:15.95,Default,,0,0,0,,start up
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.86,0:11:28.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Four windmill cannons, including no blind spots to attack
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.10,0:11:29.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Look where you run away
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.62,0:11:31.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I need to run away?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.70,0:11:34.37,Default,,0,0,0,,I use Bulala a little more
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.06,0:11:40.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I can dismantle your windmill
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.50,0:11:45.49,Default,,0,0,0,,that is
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.42,0:11:58.62,Default,,0,0,0,,The windmills are broken
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.35,0:12:08.50,Default,,0,0,0,,All struggles are in vain in the face of absolute power
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:05.00,Default,,0,0,0,,------------------------------------------------------
